      "what_must_be_true": "Wolfspeed's Mohawk Valley 200mm device fab yield curve must mature rapidly while Durham materials site achieves cost parity on 200mm wafer fabrication, enabling gross margins to inflect from negative 20%+ levels to positive territory over FY27 as AI data center and 800V automotive design wins ramp."
